# Session-local cargo target dir (CARGO_TARGET_DIR)
.petarget/

# Trust-base redesign dossier — a ~526M working directory (design docs,
# cold-handoff zips, prototypes/, specimens/) that lives BESIDE the repo
# and is never committed. It was untracked-but-unignored once, which let a
# build depend on files that were not in the repository: the kernel's
# schema/fixture includes resolved through `CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR/../` into
# this directory, so master compiled here and nowhere else.
#
# The bytes the build actually pins now live INSIDE the crate at
# kernel/src/trust_base/schemas/ (that copy is authoritative for the
# build). Nothing under kernel/ may read from this path again.
#
# The design record itself IS tracked (the .md files): the diagnosis,
# audits, specs and state-of-play are this project's institutional
# memory and have already been load-bearing in later investigations.
# Only the bulk is excluded. Nothing tracked here is a build input.
/trust-base-redesign-dossier/*
!/trust-base-redesign-dossier/*.md
